<li id="bib.bib14" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Garg et al. (2023)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
<span id="bib.bib14.1" class="ltx_text">Garg, S.</span>, <span id="bib.bib14.2" class="ltx_text">Tsipras, D.</span>, <span id="bib.bib14.3" class="ltx_text">Liang, P.</span> and <span id="bib.bib14.4" class="ltx_text">Valiant, G.</span> (2023).

